message: "If you use these certificates, verifiers, or Lean 4 formalizations, please cite this repository."
title: "Continuous Multi-Item Auction BIC-DSIC Separation, Dual Revenue Certificates, and an Exact Optimal 2x2 Unit-Demand DSIC Auction"
type: software
version: "5.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
