abstract: "Lean 4 + Mathlib proofs and exact-rational certificates for continuous multi-bidder, multi-item auctions: (1) for two unit-demand bidders and two items with i.i.d. values L + U^2 (U uniform on [0,1]), an explicit deterministic mechanism that is Lean-proved revenue-optimal among all randomized BIC + interim-IR and DSIC + ex-post IR mechanisms if and only if L >= 2/pi; and (2) strict continuous BIC > DSIC separation and H(div) Raviart-Thomas DSIC upper bounds for 2x2 and 3x2 U[0,1], 2x2 Beta(1,2), and 2x3 U[0,1]^3 additive auctions."
